WEBVTT

01:00:34.414 --> 01:00:36.039
Come on, Buzz.

01:00:37.625 --> 01:00:38.834
All right.

01:00:40.295 --> 01:00:43.088
-Hey, I'm out!
-Almost there.

01:00:48.136 --> 01:00:50.429
I want to ride the pony.

01:00:54.600 --> 01:00:58.145
Woody? Woody?
Are you all right?

01:00:59.022 --> 01:01:01.606
I'm fine. I'm okay.
